# Build context is the workspace root, so keep it small and deterministic.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out-tsc
.nx
.angular
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
.cursor
.codex
.gemini
.opencode
.agents
coverage
**/*.log

# Secrets are injected at runtime via env_file, never baked into the image
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Docs
**/*.md
